      ]
     ],
     "note": "S∞ = G₁/(1 − r), only when |r| < 1.",
     "ref": "p.38–39",
     "id": "g12.maths.u1.s1-4-1.12"
    },
    {
     "kind": "name",
     "step": "name",
     "title": "Key words",
     "defs": [
      [
       "Infinite series",
       "A sum a₁ + a₂ + a₃ + … that never ends."
